    {
      "id": 25,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Who the platform's users are, as far as the data honestly goes.**\n\nThere is no country and no locale on a user row. The only country this platform stores is on `analytics.events`, which is a *site visitor's* rather than an operator's \u2014 and it is derived from a request header with no edge in front of the platform that stamps one, so it is caller-asserted and mostly null. Inventing a geography from an IP address would be a worse answer than not having one, so it is not reported here.\n\nThere is also no `LastLoginAt` column, and there is not going to be one: the audit log already records every sign-in against a `SubjectUserId`, so a second copy on the user row would be a denormalisation that can disagree with the record of record. Last-login below is derived from the audit log.\n\nNo email address appears anywhere on this page \u2014 only a bucketed domain."
      }
    },
